-- **Truth in Redis Hash, index in Redis Sets**
-  - Chose: authoritative per-entity location record in Redis (`entity_id -> {lat, lon, ts, version, attrs}`) + geohash/quadtree buckets as candidate lists.
-  - Rejected: treating the geospatial index as authoritative.
-  - Why: correctness comes from reading one key per candidate; index can be stale without breaking results.
